    <h1>Employee access operationalization</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-moved">DRAFT</sp=
an></p>
    <p>Here are all the use cases in the employee access operation space, c=
ategorized&nbsp;<strong>by entity.</strong></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Primary account (via IIQ):</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c3ab01ed-d41c-421d-af03-d726016cca0a"><a href=3D"http=
s://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2726046072/Employee+access+request+wor=
kflow+for+onboarding+access+modification+and+job+role+change+requests" rel=
=3D"nofollow">Employee Onboarding, access modification and job role change =
requests</a></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"44798035-c5bc-4bed-b0c5-f13ca6e87975">Employee Offboa=
rding</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"de9b1a12-58a1-4730-b87a-d8d1d79c48e5">User certificat=
ion</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Secondary account&nbsp;</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"15d61378-4af2-4b10-9cea-e70fe96c043f">New request, ch=
ange request&nbsp;</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"76f09761-2f34-473f-9fa0-1df1d24fea2c">Employee offboa=
rding (tied to primary account offboarding)</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"73195ae3-bcfb-45a7-a0f7-f9a356a2d5b9">User certificat=
ion (flagged on primary account certification)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Data Solutions WebApps access</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"7fffdd8d-01b5-4f3a-9c2b-311a8e6c3694"><a href=3D"http=
s://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/NDSKW/pages/1846584538/Data+Solutions+WebApps-Access=
+Request" rel=3D"nofollow">New request, change request</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Internal access matrix</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"0e9ec85e-e09c-41d6-8db5-e26814240c1d">Change requests=
, e.g. department reorg</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"046d8d49-0868-40f4-8e24-64e6f9398cf2">New feature lau=
nch&nbsp;</li>
    </ul>
    <p><s>SAA access matrix&nbsp;</s></p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"8830df88-841f-4304-b8d1-dcf927a34b4b"><s>New feature =
launch&nbsp;</s></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Compass features and packages</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"a0406659-97fc-4283-8875-0913cab0d004">New feature lau=
nch</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"f06c21ad-cb22-4161-8ae3-34f485b5f64d">New user packag=
e</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p>Here are all use cases <strong>by events.</strong></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>New hire</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"80077f1d-aee7-4741-8452-0bc402fba532"><a href=3D"http=
s://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2726046072/Employee+access+request+wor=
kflow+for+onboarding+access+modification+and+job+role+change+requests#Emplo=
yeeaccessrequestworkflowforonboarding,accessmodificationandjobrolechangereq=
uests-NewCompass(CX)" rel=3D"nofollow">Request new access to CX (id: 6900)<=
/a></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"1978e795-591e-433c-9996-22f9e65a19b9"><a href=3D"http=
s://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2726046072/Employee+access+request+wor=
kflow+for+onboarding+access+modification+and+job+role+change+requests#Emplo=
yeeaccessrequestworkflowforonboarding,accessmodificationandjobrolechangereq=
uests-LegacyCompass(R2)" rel=3D"nofollow">Request new access to R2 (id: 521=
3)</a></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"efff9eb6-779b-491c-8b49-33a8f3a6679f"><a href=3D"http=
s://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2726046072/Employee+access+request+wor=
kflow+for+onboarding+access+modification+and+job+role+change+requests#Emplo=
yeeaccessrequestworkflowforonboarding,accessmodificationandjobrolechangereq=
uests-Datasolutionswebapps" rel=3D"nofollow">Request new access to Data Sol=
utions WebApps (1 to 12 apps)</a></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"e9881ea3-77a1-45b6-b62c-02364a7c86e8">Request new acc=
ess to SZ apps and NetRep&nbsp;=20
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"287432a2-dc39-4100-b6b9-18f5523f7c6c">Follow BAU pr=
ocess</li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Access modification or Job role change</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c4b1520e-56bd-46e4-99d7-d95e71a5d6d2"><a href=3D"http=
s://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2726046072/Employee+access+request+wor=
kflow+for+onboarding+access+modification+and+job+role+change+requests#Emplo=
yeeaccessrequestworkflowforonboarding,accessmodificationandjobrolechangereq=
uests-NewCompass(CX)" rel=3D"nofollow">Modify access to CX (id: 6900)</a></=
li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"97ca7716-b5ad-4d64-aa24-ce82a14ad53a"><a href=3D"http=
s://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2726046072/Employee+access+request+wor=
kflow+for+onboarding+access+modification+and+job+role+change+requests#Emplo=
yeeaccessrequestworkflowforonboarding,accessmodificationandjobrolechangereq=
uests-LegacyCompass(R2)" rel=3D"nofollow">Modify access to R2 (id: 5213)</a=
></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"36530b4c-0671-466f-8f87-c8dc9eeef280"><a href=3D"http=
s://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2726046072/Employee+access+request+wor=
kflow+for+onboarding+access+modification+and+job+role+change+requests#Emplo=
yeeaccessrequestworkflowforonboarding,accessmodificationandjobrolechangereq=
uests-Datasolutionswebapps" rel=3D"nofollow">Modify access to Data Solution=
s WebApps (1 to 12 apps)</a></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"88ce17a2-a396-462b-82b9-f406fc84658e">Modify access t=
o SZ apps and NetRep&nbsp;=20
      <ul>
       <li>Follow BAU process</li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Departure</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c28913dc-a929-4b7f-9889-8c4e4e7e034f">Remove access t=
o CX (id: 6900) and any secondary accounts</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"8ff25b98-2864-472f-9261-7cf63fddc857">Remove access t=
o R2 (id: 5213)</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"69339230-d859-4892-9ef7-2a2979eb823b">Remove access t=
o DWH&nbsp;</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Additional id&nbsp;</p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Feature launch &amp; update</p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
